## Work completed

**Root cause:** `app/globals.css` contained named CSS classes (`.hero-shade`, `.eyebrow`, `.button`, `.stat`, `.process-row`, etc.), which the build rejects. The fix was to remove all named classes from globals.css and replace their usages in `app/page.tsx` with Tailwind utilities.

**`app/globals.css` rewritten** — now keeps only the Tailwind imports, `:root` CSS variables, base element resets (`*`, `html`, `body`, `h1`-`h3`, `blockquote`, `a`, `img`, `::selection`), and the reduced-motion block. All named classes removed.

**`app/page.tsx` conversions completed:**
- Logo: `logo-light` → `brightness-0 invert`
- Nav links: `nav-link` → Tailwind `after:` underline animation utilities
- Header button: `button button-light` → Tailwind utilities
- Hero section: removed `hero` class, added `max-sm:min-h-[740px]`
- Hero shade: `hero-shade` → arbitrary `bg-[linear-gradient(...)] `
- Hero eyebrow, hero button, "The Greenwood standard" eyebrow → Tailwind
- Stats: `.stat`, `.stat strong`, `.stat span` → Tailwind utilities (with sm/mobile border and padding variants)
- "Selected residences" eyebrow → Tailwind
- Portfolio `text-link` → Tailwind
- Project images: `project img` → `saturate-[0.82]`
- "A considered process" eyebrow → Tailwind

